---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "Do I need any AI experience to work with you?",
    answer:
      "Not at all. We work with people who are just starting out, as well as those who have some experience but want to take their AI skills to the next level.",
  },
  {
    question: "How much time do I need to set aside for coaching or an audit?",
    answer:
      "Coaching sessions and audit consultations are typically 60-90 minutes each. Your roadmap integrates directly into your business processes, so you will actually be saving time!",
  },
  {
    question: "What's the difference between an AI Audit and 1:1 Coaching?",
    answer:
      "AI Audits are a one-time consultation where we assess your business and create a roadmap for integrating AI into your systems. 1:1 Coaching is an ongoing process where we work with you to implement the roadmap and help you take action on your AI strategy.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you recommend specific AI tools, or is this more about strategy?",
    answer:
      "We focus on strategy and implementation, but we do recommend specific AI tools that are best suited for your business needs. We will help you choose the right tools and show you how to use them effectively.",
  },
  {
    question: "How quickly will I start seeing results?",
    answer:
      "In your roadmap there will be quick wins along with longer-term strategies. You can start seeing results in just a few hours, and the more you put into it, the more you'll get out of it.",
  },
];
---

<section id="faq" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
  <h2 class="text-center text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl">
    Frequently Asked Questions
  </h2>

  <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3">
    {faqs.map((faq) => (
      <details class="faq-item group rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-5 py-4">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <span class="font-bold text-gray-900">{faq.question}</span>
          <span
            class="faq-icon relative mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-none text-gray-500"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">{faq.answer}</p>
      </details>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-icon::before,
  .faq-icon::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    background-color: currentColor;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .faq-icon::before {
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .faq-icon::after {
    width: 2px;
    height: 100%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-icon::after {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(90deg) scale(0);
  }
</style>
